1
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
"The Last Oath"

2
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:28,800
(Episode 12: Casia)

3
00:01:39,041 --> 00:01:40,041
Hang in there.

4
00:01:41,166 --> 00:01:43,086
I'll get you somewhere
safe to treat that wound.

5
00:01:44,375 --> 00:01:45,666
I'm fine.

6
00:01:46,708 --> 00:01:47,750
Put me down.

7
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:49,583
I can walk.

8
00:01:50,083 --> 00:01:51,333
You're still acting tough.

9
00:01:51,583 --> 00:01:52,416
If you fall again,

10
00:01:52,417 --> 00:01:53,817
I'll just have to carry you anyway.

11
00:02:15,333 --> 00:02:16,333
The arrow was poisoned.

12
00:03:05,041 --> 00:03:06,721
The poisoned blood is finally cleared out.

13
00:03:07,291 --> 00:03:08,291
You...

14
00:03:42,625 --> 00:03:43,625
Jerk.

15
00:03:44,166 --> 00:03:45,666
Meeting you was a curse.

16
00:03:53,833 --> 00:03:54,875
Get well soon.

17
00:04:38,583 --> 00:04:39,625
The fever finally broke.

18
00:04:50,916 --> 00:04:51,916
Leave me alone.

19
00:04:53,166 --> 00:04:54,166
Go.

20
00:05:36,166 --> 00:05:37,208
It's yours now.

21
00:05:38,666 --> 00:05:39,666
Protect yourself.

22
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,708
I'm going with you,

23
00:05:58,709 --> 00:06:00,269
but that doesn't make me your prisoner.

24
00:06:01,541 --> 00:06:03,261
Getting to headquarters as soon as possible

25
00:06:03,291 --> 00:06:04,458
is best for everyone.

26
00:06:06,166 --> 00:06:07,166
Don't forget,

27
00:06:07,791 --> 00:06:08,916
he's a hunter.

28
00:06:09,166 --> 00:06:10,583
You're just his prey.

29
00:06:10,875 --> 00:06:12,416
A lab rat he needs to catch.

30
00:06:19,416 --> 00:06:21,250
Test if the target is immune.

31
00:06:21,583 --> 00:06:23,250
Target confirmed as immune.

32
00:06:23,666 --> 00:06:25,833
Taming a biting dog is simple.

33
00:06:27,541 --> 00:06:30,000
Just pull out its fangs.

34
00:06:30,958 --> 00:06:32,166
You bastard.

35
00:06:33,625 --> 00:06:35,958
And to think I considered you a
friend and trusted you so much.

36
00:06:36,416 --> 00:06:38,416
I just need to make sure you stay alive.

37
00:06:43,291 --> 00:06:44,458
Let go, you jerk!

38
00:06:45,791 --> 00:06:48,000
Don't force me to use
the same methods on you

39
00:06:48,708 --> 00:06:50,125
that I use on everyone else.

40
00:06:53,750 --> 00:06:54,750
Just go.

41
00:06:55,291 --> 00:06:58,000
If you stay any longer,
you won't be able to leave.

42
00:06:58,750 --> 00:07:00,375
Now is your best chance.

43
00:07:41,625 --> 00:07:42,625
Lin Zai!

44
00:07:46,583 --> 00:07:47,583
Lin Zai!

45
00:07:49,291 --> 00:07:50,291
Don't leave me behind!

46
00:08:26,708 --> 00:08:28,000
No, no!

47
00:08:40,125 --> 00:08:43,000
Mom, Dad!

48
00:08:47,083 --> 00:08:48,083
Useless trash.

49
00:08:48,708 --> 00:08:49,988
If you can't get up on your own,

50
00:08:50,416 --> 00:08:51,416
then rot here

51
00:08:52,166 --> 00:08:53,166
and wait to die.

52
00:09:10,583 --> 00:09:11,583
Don't go.

53
00:09:12,875 --> 00:09:13,958
Don't leave me behind.

54
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,125
Why did you come back?

55
00:11:02,250 --> 00:11:03,791
You could have left.

56
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,708
Even if you had abandoned me today,

57
00:11:08,291 --> 00:11:09,791
I wouldn't have been surprised.

58
00:11:11,666 --> 00:11:12,958
I'm used to it.

59
00:11:16,708 --> 00:11:17,708
Used to what?

60
00:11:20,541 --> 00:11:21,833
Used to being abandoned.

61
00:11:26,208 --> 00:11:27,332
To save one's own life

62
00:11:27,333 --> 00:11:28,333
by sacrificing others...

63
00:11:28,791 --> 00:11:30,458
Isn't that human instinct?

64
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:37,583
When it really counts,

65
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,457
even your own parents

66
00:11:40,458 --> 00:11:42,338
or comrades who have
been through hell with you

67
00:11:45,958 --> 00:11:47,291
can't be relied on.

68
00:12:00,333 --> 00:12:01,333
So you...

69
00:12:03,958 --> 00:12:05,208
why did you come back?

70
00:12:14,041 --> 00:12:15,041
A-Leh,

71
00:12:17,208 --> 00:12:18,583
I'm not like them.

72
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:24,333
I have a heart.

73
00:12:27,541 --> 00:12:28,250
S-So...

74
00:12:28,250 --> 00:12:29,250
Listen, A-Leh.

75
00:12:32,875 --> 00:12:33,916
If I go with you,

76
00:12:34,625 --> 00:12:35,625
will I die?

77
00:13:01,041 --> 00:13:02,166
I will risk my life

78
00:13:05,125 --> 00:13:06,125
to protect you.

79
00:15:26,666 --> 00:15:27,666
Is this OK?
